# gas remover next to dangerous gases: BN erases from the std::map inside a
# range-for and increments the erased iterator (UB). Crashes the Reference build.
region 1 1
ter all t_dirt
field 6 6 fd_gas_remover 1 1
field 5 5 fd_toxic_gas 2 1
field 6 5 fd_smoke 2 1
field 7 5 fd_tear_gas 2 1
field 5 6 fd_toxic_gas 2 1
field 7 6 fd_toxic_gas 2 1
field 7 6 fd_smoke 2 1
field 5 7 fd_toxic_gas 2 1
field 6 7 fd_toxic_gas 2 1
field 7 7 fd_relax_gas 2 1
field 6 6 fd_smoke 2 1
